78
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:40,580
I'm a medical student in a foreign country and I'm writing this email to you on the account of my observations.

79
00:04:40,660 --> 00:04:47,020
Among most Desi students around me, and I hope you can share with you can share this with your audience.

80
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:49,780
Since a large number of youngsters listen to you and follow your advice.

81
00:04:49,860 --> 00:05:00,618
I have been studying here since 2019 and I have yet to come across another Desi student who has the basic life skills of managing a house like cleaning after themselves,

82
00:05:00,698 --> 00:05:03,140
cooking, basic food or washing a bathroom.

83
00:05:03,650 --> 00:05:09,090
By this I do not mean that all diseases are like that, but from what I have observed, most are.

84
00:05:09,170 --> 00:05:18,530
All these kids dream of going to a foreign land to study and build careers and they only see the bright side of it like it is depicted in movies and shows.

85
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:25,410
But the harsh reality is that it takes a lot of work and struggle to manage your studies, your household and your social life.

86
00:05:25,490 --> 00:05:30,860
I have lived in three separate apartments in the past three years, solely due to the reason that every housemate I.

87
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:37,780
I had was absolutely uncooperative when it came to dividing the tasks of the house like sweeping and mopping the floors,

88
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:40,950
keeping the washroom clean, doing dishes, et cetera.

89
00:05:41,030 --> 00:05:41,958
On the other hand,

90
00:05:42,038 --> 00:05:47,269
you go to visit a friend's home who is from this country or from some other Western country,

91
00:05:47,349 --> 00:05:53,580
