92
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:57,640
Now the question is, why are kids in our society not taught these basic.

93
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:02,860
basic life skills in general and then specifically when parents are about to send them abroad for studies.

94
00:06:02,940 --> 00:06:06,025
It isn't just studying that you come for really now, is it?

95
00:06:06,105 --> 00:06:13,340
Living abroad and away from family comes with a whole bunch of other responsibilities that these kids are never prepared for.

96
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:17,060
And then they become an inconvenience for people like me.

97
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,249
It's mostly the girls.

98
00:06:18,329 --> 00:06:22,080
It's mostly that girls are taught all these basic life skills.

