00:06:38,379 --> 00:06:43,393
No, she is not a kid and she is not just magically going to learn on her own one day.

105
00:06:43,473 --> 00:06:49,788
It is your responsibility as a parent to instill these basic life skills into your kid to help them.

106
00:06:49,868 --> 00:06:52,070
And boys are forbidden to even stay

107
00:06:52,150 --> 00:06:57,570
