108
00:06:57,650 --> 00:07:00,168
no matter where in the world they are going.

109
00:07:00,248 --> 00:07:02,309
There is just no prep given to them,

110
00:07:02,389 --> 00:07:06,079
to these kids before they leave to live abroad at all.

111
00:07:06,159 --> 00:07:12,729
Kids are so pampered in our society and therefore frown upon doing house chores as if it would make them a maid.

112
